   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2017-09-19",
   "text": "Protecting Workers and Improving Labor Standards Act\n This bill amends the National Labor Relations Act to allow labor agreements to require membership in a labor organization as a condition of employment regardless of state law (thus preempting state laws that prohibit such agreements)."
  }
